      "show_title_separator": true,
      "text": "[#](53341a)Before kettles and distilleries, every witch learns the cauldron.[#]()",
      "title": "The Witch's Cauldron",
      "use_markdown_in_title": false
    },
    {
      "type": "modonomicon:text",
