      "condition": {
        "type": "modonomicon:none"
      },
      "show_title_separator": false,
      "text": "[#](53341a)Anointing Paste is what wakes an ordinary cauldron into a Witch's Cauldron — the vessel behind the cauldron paths already mentioned above.[#]()",
      "title": " ",
      "use_markdown_in_title": false
    },
    {
      "type": "modonomicon:text",
      "anchor": "",
      "condition": {
        "type": "modonomicon:none"
      },
      "show_title_separator": false,
      "text": "[#](53341a)It is the earliest real progression gate in the craft, because so many foundational brews begin in its bowl.[#]()",
      "title": " ",
      "use_markdown_in_title": false
    },
    {
      "type": "modonomicon:crafting_recipe",
      "anchor": "",
      "condition": {
        "type": "modonomicon:none"
      },
      "recipe_id_1": "witchery:anointing_paste",
      "text": "[#](53341a)**Water Artichoke**, **Mandrake**, **Belladonna**, and **Snowbell** seeds make four paste. Grass and ferns drop those seeds again.[#]()",
      "title1": "Anointing Paste",
      "title2": ""
    },
    {
