      "anchor": "",
      "condition": {
        "type": "modonomicon:none"
      },
      "item": {
        "count": 1,
        "item": "minecraft:cauldron"
      },
      "text": "[#](53341a)Apply the paste to a placed cauldron, then give it a fire and water. Drop reagents in the bowl and trigger the working with the last item by hand — the cauldron workings named throughout this primer follow.[#]()",
      "title": "Witch's Cauldron"
    },
